# INT3095-Assignment-1
---
## installation

This project is doing the Assignment 1 from Int3095

## Use

To run this project, you need to run the following command:

```powershell
python run_as_cli.py
```

You can build the project by running the following command:
```powershell
.\build.ps1
```

